      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-text-primary mt-8 mb-3">4. Intellectual property</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">The content, design, and code of this site are the property of Calcumetrics and its operators. Mathematical formulas are in the public domain; their specific implementation and explanatory content on this site are not.</p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-text-primary mt-8 mb-3">5. Changes to terms</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">We may update these terms from time to time. Continued use after a change constitutes acceptance of the updated terms.</p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-text-primary mt-8 mb-3">6. Governing law</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed">These terms are governed by applicable law. For legal disputes, contact us at hello@calcumetrics.com before initiating legal proceedings.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
